---
// Privacy policy describing the site AS IT IS TODAY: no cookies, no
// analytics, no ads. It MUST be updated before analytics or AdSense go live
// (see the "Changes" section and AdSlot.astro).
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import ContactEmail from '../components/ContactEmail.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — StrengthCalc"
  h1="Privacy Policy"
  description="StrengthCalc's privacy policy: no accounts, no cookies, no analytics. Calculations run in your browser and nothing you enter is sent to us."
  path="/privacy/"
  name="Privacy Policy"
>
  <p class="answer">
    In short: {SITE.name} has no accounts, sets no cookies and shows no ads. We count visits with
    cookie-free, privacy-focused analytics. The calculators run entirely in your browser — the
    numbers you enter are not sent to us.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This policy covers {SITE.name} (the &ldquo;site&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;), operated
    independently under the {SITE.name} name. Contact: <ContactEmail />.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we do not collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No account, signup or login exists.</li>
    <li>Weights, reps, bodyweight and other calculator inputs are processed in your browser and are not transmitted to or stored by us.</li>
    <li>We do not use cookies, advertising, or tracking that follows you across other websites.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Visitor statistics</h2>
  <p>
    We use <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>
    to understand how many people visit and which pages are useful. It does not use cookies or
    local storage, and we only see aggregated figures — such as page views, the referring website,
    browser type and country — never anything that identifies you. Your calculator inputs are not
    included.
  </p>

  <h2>Preferences saved on your device</h2>
  <p>
    If you switch between kg and lb, or between the light and dark theme, the site remembers that
    choice using your browser&rsquo;s local storage, so the next page opens the way you like it. Only
    those two settings are stored — never your weights, reps or other inputs — and they stay on your
    device; they are never sent to us or anyone else. You can remove them at any time by clearing
    this site&rsquo;s data in your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Share links</h2>
  <p>
    If you use &ldquo;Copy share link&rdquo;, your inputs are placed in the page address (for example
    <code>?w=225&amp;r=5&amp;u=lb</code>). That link stays on your device unless you choose to share it.
    Anyone you send it to — and any service you paste it into — can see those values.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
  <p>
    The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Like any web host, Cloudflare processes technical
    information needed to deliver pages and protect the service, such as your IP address, browser
    type and the pages requested. This is handled under
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare&rsquo;s privacy policy</a>.
    We do not use this information to identify visitors.
  </p>

  <h2>If you email us</h2>
  <p>
    If you contact us, we receive your email address and whatever you write. We use it only to
    reply, keep it only as long as needed for that conversation, and never sell or share it.
    You can ask us to delete it at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Pages link to outside sources, such as research references and Cloudflare. Those sites have
    their own privacy practices, which this policy does not cover.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    The site is intended for a general adult audience and is not directed at children under 13.
    We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR in the EU/UK or state laws such as the
    CCPA in California), you may have rights to access, correct or delete personal data about you.
    Because the only personal data we may hold is an email you sent us, you can exercise these
    rights by contacting us at <ContactEmail />. We do not sell or share personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If we add analytics or advertising in the future — for example Google AdSense, which uses cookies
    to serve and measure ads — we will update this policy <strong>before</strong> those features go
    live, describe what is collected and by whom, and, where the law requires it, ask for your consent
    first. The date at the top of this page shows when the policy last changed.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
